# `.pubignore` replaces `.gitignore` for `dart pub publish`. Re-list the
# gitignored paths plus everything that should not ship to consumers.

# From `.gitignore`:
.dart_tool/
tmp/
/coverage/

# Dev artefacts and AI/contributor docs (not part of the published API).
.claude/
.github/
test/
AGENTS.md

# Lockfile is local to the maintainer; library consumers resolve their own.
pubspec.lock
